	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A guy named Bill made the homie\nPC storage system.\rYou can use it from the PC by\nthe counter. Try it out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Like three years ago,\nthis gang called The Feds\fwas out here doin’ dirt.\fThey was abusin’ homies.\rBut!\nDirt don’t last!\rSome kid ran ’em off the block\nand The Feds got shut down!\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Homies ain’t dumb.\nA traded homie might not listen\fright away. High-level homies\fwon’t listen if you ain’t\fgot enough Block Chains.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: Wassup!\nYou KNOW this face. I’m from\fthe TV show,\f“The Show Me Show!”\rI’m Primo, the big bro!\rSo, fan, you wanna tell me\nwhat you think of me? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: Whoa...!\nThat’s how you feel about me?!\rI never thought about it like that.\nAnyway, how you like how fun\fand exciting I am?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: For real?\rThat give me brand-new energy\nto go even harder!\rGreat feedback! Good looks.\nKeep watchin’, fam!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t be sayin’ you\nain’t into the big bro...?\rNah, that can’t be true!\nYou just busy right now,\fain’t you? Gotta be that!\rHit me with some answers\nwhen you got time for me.\rPeace!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: ...!\rAin’t no regular fan know\nthat kinda thing!\rYou a Hustler, right?\nI’ma pull some strings for you.\rI can prob’ly get you a new\nwallpaper for your PC Boxes.\rKeep your TV locked on\n“The Show Me Show!”\rAnd don’t forget about me,\nthe big bro!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: ...!\rAin’t no regular fan know\nthat kinda thing!\rYou a Hustler, right?\nI’ma pull some strings for you.\rI can prob’ly hook you up\nwith a Mystery Gift.\rKeep your TV locked on\n“The Show Me Show!”\rAnd don’t forget about me,\nthe big bro!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: ...!\rAin’t no regular fan know\nthat kinda thing!\rYou a Hustler, right?\nI’ma pull some strings for you.\rI can prob’ly hook you up\nwith this Egg.\fTake care of it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the\n{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} Egg from Primo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Primo: ...!\rAin’t no regular fan know\nthat kinda thing!\rYou a Hustler, right?\nI’ma pull some strings for you.\rI can prob’ly hook you up\nwith this Egg.\fTake care of it!\r...\rYour crew full, so I\ncan’t give it to you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm...\rWhat kinda Hustler you\nfeelin’ the most?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What kinda Hustler you\ntryna be? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kinda Hustler\nyou tryna be? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bet! So {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kinda\nHustler you like.\rThen people might start\nseein’ you like that too.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Holla at me again if you wanna\nchange what kinda Hustler\fyou like.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0559_T22PC0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup! People been mistakin’ you\nfor {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0}, huh?\rBut I think you could pass for\na different kinda Hustler.\rSo what kinda Hustler\nyou like?\r</language>
	</row>
